{42}{Tarant is ruled by the Tarantian Industrial Council, of which I am the Chairman.  We are a group of businessmen and politicians who make laws based upon what we feel is best for both the commercial and [He clears his throat.] cultural future of our fair city...}{Tarant is ruled by the Tarantian Industrial Council, of which I am the Chairman.  We are a group of businessmen and politicians who make laws based upon what we feel is best for both the commercial and [He clears his throat.] cultural future of our fair city...}{}{}{}{}
